[Slow] 和歌山県の智弁和歌山高校が、群馬県の健大高崎高校に4対3で勝って、優勝しました。

23
00:03:32,312 --> 00:03:41,168
[Host] Chiben Wakayama, from Wakayama Prefecture, beat Kendai Takasaki from Gunma four to three and took the championship.

24
00:03:41,768 --> 00:03:44,120
[Vocab] 優勝

25
