[Host] It means going ahead — taking the lead in the score.

42
00:05:18,432 --> 00:05:28,151
[Slow] 試合が終わると、選手たちはマウンドの上に集まって、歓喜の輪を作りました。

43
00:05:28,951 --> 00:05:34,831
[Host] When the game ended, the players gathered on the mound and formed a circle of joy.

44
00:05:35,432 --> 00:05:37,663
[Vocab] 歓喜

45
00:05:38,064 --> 00:05:40,800
[Host] It means great joy, or delight.

46
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:53,567
[Slow] 健大高崎は、今回が初めての決勝進出でしたが、優勝まであと一歩、届きませんでした。

47
00:05:54,367 --> 00:06:00,656
[Host] Kendai Takasaki reached the final for the first time, but fell one step short of the title.

48
00:06:01,255 --> 00:06:04,423
