49
00:06:04,824 --> 00:06:07,151
[Host] It means advancing to the final.

50
00:06:07,752 --> 00:06:15,839
[Slow] 全国の高校球児の熱い夏が、今日、幕を閉じました。

51
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:21,608
[Host] The hot summer of high school ballplayers across Japan came to a close today.

52
